"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7d22e6414925057\" href=\"?note=e7d22e6414925057\" title=\"27-df-implicates\">27-df-implicates</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f))=f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f))=f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 a 是假点，包含所有文字且仅在 a 为假的 maxterm 是 implicate；有限次删文字到 prime implicate 仍在 a 为假。因此所有 prime implicate 的合取在假点为 0，在真点为 1。恒真函数没有非恒真 implicate，空 CNF 给出 1；恒假函数有空子句。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-implicates","status":"resolved","id":"e7d22e6414925057","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-implicates]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-implicates","status":"resolved","id":"e7d22e6414925057","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-implicates]]，$\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-cnf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-implicates]]，$\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-cnf]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f))=f.","display":true}],"bytes":1234,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-518","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-primecnf|thm-primecnf — Prime implicates give the canonical CNF]]"}],"outgoing":["e7d22e6414925057","6b749704e82fc727"]}